Create a .gitignore file for a Python reinforcement learning project with the following entries:

## Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python

## Virtual environment
venv/
.venv/
.venv_cuda/
env/
ENV/
.python-version

## Training outputs
checkpoints/
graphs/
rewards.csv
winrate.csv
fresh_start.flag
*.png
*.tar.gz

## PyTorch
*.pth
*.pt

## Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.ipynb

## IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.user

## OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

## Logs
*.log
logs/
*.out
*.err

## Python packaging / build artifacts
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
